WEBVTT

00:15:28.860 --> 00:15:32.340
Technology can go anywhere,
but human connection is needed,

00:15:32.340 --> 00:15:35.210
as it exists in our culture and tradition.

00:15:37.010 --> 00:15:39.810
A lot of young people are here
as you can see them,

00:15:39.810 --> 00:15:42.820
a lot of young people at home
who are listening.

00:15:42.820 --> 00:15:46.790
Sundar, we follow your way of being.

00:15:46.790 --> 00:15:48.570
We've read about him.

00:15:48.570 --> 00:15:50.740
Always everything starts with an idea.

00:15:50.740 --> 00:15:54.340
What is the secret to see an idea
through to its end?

00:15:54.340 --> 00:15:57.920
Do you have an idea worth sharing
with us on Ted Talks India Nayi Soch?

00:15:57.920 --> 00:15:59.290
Do you have such an idea --

00:15:59.290 --> 00:16:01.770
because lots of people 
are going to watch this on TV,